  {
    "id": 2009014110010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今日はメイクさんとたくさんお話したんですー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040090070",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、どんな話をしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "美味しいおかしを聞きました！\r\nコンビニとかスーパーで買えるやつです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "『お友達と食べる時とか、\r\n放クラのみんなとつまむ時におすすめ！』って！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "たくさんありすぎて覚えられなくって……\r\nチェインで送ってもらいました……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ、いいな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "チョコはちょこ先輩が美味しいのを分けてくれるので、\r\n友達を呼んだ時のおやつにするんです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それで、チョコじゃないのを\r\nみなさんと一緒に食べます……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなとか……\r\nじゃあさ、果穂",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……？\r\nなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──取引をしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1800
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "取引……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "メイクさんから聞いたお菓子について聞かせてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし情報を提供してくれたなら、\r\n俺が事務所のおやつとして買ってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いいんですかっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、俺からの提案だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "情報料としては不足ないと思ってるんだけど、どうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "問題……ありません……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901411/2009014110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──OK、契約成立だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014110120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ\r\nはいっ！　成立です！",
